mber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">3. 南紀勝浦温泉 くつろぎの宿 料理旅館 万清楼（勝浦港すぐ）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68247/68247.jpg\" alt=\"南紀勝浦温泉　くつろぎの宿　料理旅館　万清楼 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜勝浦港の目の前！生まぐろと熊野牛の本格懐石を味わう落ち着いた和風割烹旅館〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">美食家、シニア、ご夫婦、落ち着いた大人の旅。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「勝浦港の絶品生マグロ料理とおもてなしを静かに味わうなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F68247%2F68247.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via